{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S08仅停留20秒，却安排了四句叙述和多组未标时点的感受，扫读压力明显高于X；S09把“难受时想有人陪”改成“孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，对人物动机的解释稍显过度。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮关键词建立了清楚的视觉入口，感受提示又能随音乐段落出现，观众更容易先抓住人物正在经历什么，再把具体声音和情绪对应起来。它对亲近为何引出委屈、不服气消退后为何显出失落等心理转折交代得更清楚，贯穿全篇的“当作自己人—独自扛—不急着回头—带着想念继续生活”也形成了更连贯的线索。尤其在音乐感受上，Y不只说悲伤、焦虑、温暖，而是提供了动作、身体反应、音色和节奏变化，细腻程度更高。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1c5dcc6b-0ebe-4f62-813b-8ea795f22e98", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T012003253489Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.766, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:21:33.022556+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "02f2a0d7d14e771f1e0c5eff7a5b651dc32d5d6c83709f78ba294af521025e84", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4